    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 알고 있어요.\n당신이 강한 포켓몬 트레이너라는 걸요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020C54CACE00020C788C5B4C694002E000AB2F9C2E0C7740020AC15D55C0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020D2B8B808C774B108B77CB2940020AC78C694002E00100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런 상대를 이기려면\n한 우물만 파야 하는 법이죠!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n제가 애착을 갖고 있는 타입인\n벌레타입 포켓몬들로 공격하겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F00020C0C1B300B97C0020C774AE30B824BA74000AD55C0020C6B0BB3CB9CC0020D30CC57C0020D558B2940020BC95C774C8E0002100100001BE01000AC81CAC000020C560CC29C7440020AC16ACE00020C788B2940020D0C0C785C778000ABC8CB808D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4B85C0020ACF5ACA9D558ACA0C5B4C694002100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "애정 위에 지략이 만들어지고\n그 지략이 강함을 만들어 내는 법!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n자! 저와 승부해 주시죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C560C8150020C704C5D00020C9C0B7B5C7740020B9CCB4E4C5B4C9C0ACE0000AADF80020C9C0B7B5C7740020AC15D568C7440020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B0B4B2940020BC95002100100001BE00000AC79000210020C800C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC2DCC8E0002100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저와 승부할 각오가 되셨다면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C6400020C2B9BD80D5600020AC01C624AC000020B418C168B2E4BA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자! 제 벌레타입 포켓몬들과\n승부해 주시죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C79000210020C81C0020BC8CB808D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4ACFC000AC2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC2DCC8E0002100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네에? 벌레타입은 약점도 많은데...\n불꽃이라든지, 바위라든지, 비행이라든지...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124C5D0003F0020BC8CB808D0C0C785C7400020C57DC810B3C40020B9CEC740B370002E002E002E000ABD88AF43C774B77CB4E0C9C0002C0020BC14C704B77CB4E0C9C0002C0020BE44D589C774B77CB4E0C9C0002E002E002E00100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저의 사랑스러운 벌레타입 포켓몬의\n잠재력을 끌어내는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n메가진화를 사용할 테니 각오하세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C7580020C0ACB791C2A4B7ECC6B40020BC8CB808D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACC758000AC7A0C7ACB825C7440020B04CC5B4B0B4B29400100001BE00000ABA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020C0ACC6A9D5600020D14CB2C80020AC01C624D558C138C694002100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화한 쁘사이저도 그렇고\n다들 수고 많았어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654D55C0020C058C0ACC774C800B3C40020ADF8B807ACE0000AB2E4B4E40020C218ACE00020B9CEC558C5B4002E00100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러고 보니, 메가진화를 다루는 사람이\n꽤 많아진 것 같지 않나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECACE00020BCF4B2C8002C0020BA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020B2E4B8E8B2940020C0ACB78CC774000AAF640020B9CEC544C9C40020AC830020AC19C9C00020C54AB098C694003F00100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "소문에 의하면, 퀘이사 주식회사가\n메가링을 개발할 수 있었던 배경에는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nAZ라는 사람의 도움이 있었대요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C18CBB38C5D00020C758D558BA74002C0020D018C774C0AC0020C8FCC2DDD68CC0ACAC00000ABA54AC00B9C1C7440020AC1CBC1CD5600020C2180020C788C5C8B3580020BC30ACBDC5D0B29400100001BE00000A0041005AB77CB2940020C0ACB78CC7580020B3C4C6C0C7740020C788C5C8B300C694002E00100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그랬군요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ACAD70C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대단하네요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300B2E8D558B124C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "AZ라는 사람은\n여기서 멀리 떨어진 호연이라는 곳에서<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n메가진화의 기원이라고도 할 수 있는 현상을\n알게 된 뒤로 독자적으로 조사를 했었고...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 조사 결과를 퀘이사 주식회사에\n공유했다는 모양이에요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n어째서 그런 일을 한 걸까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020C870C0AC0020ACB0ACFCB97C0020D018C774C0AC0020C8FCC2DDD68CC0ACC5D0000AACF5C720D588B2E4B2940020BAA8C591C774C5D0C694002E00100001BE00000AC5B4C9F8C11C0020ADF8B7F00020C77CC7440020D55C0020AC78AE4CC694003F00100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 저는 사랑스러운 포켓몬을\n메가진화시킬 수 있게 돼서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n너무나도 만족하고 있지만요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n우리 모두 메가진화를 소중히 여기도록 해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    }
